WEBVTT

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:20.040
Rental Magica

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:02.510
Grandmother.

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:05.180
Mikan is returning.

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:06.010
What?

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:09.380
The ritual... begins.

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:19.260
Is the ritual... not yet ended?

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.370
Episode 19
THE MEDIUM'S BIRTHPLACE

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:36.580
I've been waiting for you.

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:39.580
Welcome home, Miss Mikan.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.280
I'm back.

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:43.450
Let us go to the mansion.

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:56.230
Heki-ken!

00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:58.570
San-ken!

00:03:00.010 --> 00:03:02.410
Work with the eye, Young Master.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:04.640
With the eye.

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:07.170
Don't let it control you.

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:09.170
Fight together with it.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:10.910
Hou-ken!

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:17.450
You're really into it, huh?

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:20.360
Honami.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.200
Why don't you catch your breath?

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:27.230
Here.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:28.770
Thanks.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:34.210
I wish you'd be as enthusiastic
with your magic studies, Boss.

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.000
Um, well, you know...

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:40.640
It's so quiet.

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:41.340
Huh?

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:43.840
Too quiet.

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:49.250
Yeah.

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:53.620
Mikan and Nekoyashiki
have been away for so long.

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:07.880
Welcome back!
Nekoyashiki
Mikan Home Visit
COMING HOME TODAY?

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.340
Welcome back!
Nekoyashiki
Mikan Home Visit
COMING HOME TODAY?
Has it really been two weeks
since Mikan went home?

00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:13.680
Astral's had to shut down as a result.

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:16.840
Even that pain in the butt
Addie's back in England now.

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:21.990
It feels so weird not having everyone around.

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:24.590
Is that your self-awareness developing, Boss?

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:26.750
Well, I've been sort of trying.

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:30.530
You're the president. Don't just "sort of" try.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:31.890
Right...

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:33.260
Here we go.

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.340
The tea's ready.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:38.660
What's wrong?

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:42.340
Byakko's looking forward to
Nekoyashiki coming home, too.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:44.310
Byakko?

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:51.510
Has something happened to
Nekoyashiki and Mikan?

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.190
Let's give Mikan's home a call.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.950
What did you mean just now?!

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:00.620
What do you mean you
won't let Mikan come back?!

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:02.890
Let me speak to Nekoyashiki!

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:08.470
We haven't heard from that
onmyouji for a week now.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:12.430
Nekoyashiki's... disappeared?

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:33.860
We're off.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.960
We'll go to Mikan and Nekoyashiki.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:45.930
So, what's Mikan's home like?

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:49.300
They're top-class among
the Shinto associations.

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:51.480
Are they really that great?

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:56.350
They were known even in England
when I was studying abroad.

00:05:56.680 --> 00:06:00.450
So, why did Mikan leave a place like that?

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:01.990
Who knows?

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:10.190
Come to think of it, I don't know
very much about Mikan at all.

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:16.070
Because... I'm not just a substitute!

00:06:17.240 --> 00:06:21.500
She doesn't seem to talk
about her home very much.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.270
We'll understand when we get there.

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:26.440
Right...

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:42.590
The spiritual energy is strong here.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:46.700
Peoples' thoughts tend to accumulate
in areas that held capitals.

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:48.760
People's... thoughts...

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.830
Good thoughts... and bad ones, too.

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:55.340
Well?

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:57.940
Yeah.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:06:59.500
I feel a lot better.

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:01.170
That's good.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:03.350
Ah, is it you?

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:07.750
Are you Itsuki Iba, the president of Astral?

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:14.850
A-A-An oni?!

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:18.300
Oni? That's a heck of a thing to say!

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:22.900
Pardon me if I have the wrong guy.

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.330
My name's Tatsumi Shitou.

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:31.080
Old lady Katsuragi asked me to
guide you up to the mansion.

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:33.840
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:45.190
Shitou, what's your relationship
with the Katsuragi family?

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.250
Please, just call me Tatsumi.

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:49.900
I used to be a guardian of the Katsuragi family.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.730
I had to leave that role for a reason,

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:55.260
but I've been called back for this.

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:56.740
Guardian?

00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:59.060
Essentially, I'm a bodyguard.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:00.270
How about you?

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:04.740
Did the old lady call you out
here to perform the ritual?

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:05.940
Ritual?
Ritual?

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:07.440
Am I wrong?

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:10.710
Um... How do I put this?

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:13.390
Well, sorry to interrupt the conversation...

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.420
...but we're here.

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:19.390
I will say it again.

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:23.690
I cannot return Mikan to Astral.

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:25.660
And does Mikan consent to that?

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:28.460
The child's feelings make no difference.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:36.180
The problem for us is that we
require the power she has inherited.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:37.300
That's all.

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:38.210
But!

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:40.310
How can you be so heartless,

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:42.080
not considering Mikan's feelings about this?!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.480
Her feelings don't matter.

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:47.120
That's how a society works.

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:48.290
Honami...

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:52.090
It's good that you understand.

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:56.020
I'm sorry you came all the way out here,
but please leave now.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:08:58.920
The Katsuragi family's point of view is valid.

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:04.000
However, whether The Association will
go along with it is another matter.

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:04.910
Honami?

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:05.070
Doesn't The Association have a rule that Mikan,
Honami?

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:07.780
Doesn't The Association have a rule that Mikan,

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:10.740
being registered with Astral,
must be returned to us?

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:14.480
I understand.

00:09:15.250 --> 00:09:21.350
In that case, I will consider it
if you exterminate an oni for us.

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:22.680
Oni?

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.220
Yes. An oni.

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:31.830
The Katsuragi family wishes to engage
Astral as Rental Magica for this.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:37.070
You'll return Mikan to us if we kill this oni?

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:43.670
It comes.

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:47.310
Look!

00:09:54.390 --> 00:09:55.320
What's that?

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:57.580
That is the oni.

00:09:58.690 --> 00:09:59.520
Oni?!
Oni?!

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:12.600
Is the ritual not yet ended?

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:18.480
Lady Suzuka!

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:19.710
Hail!

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:22.740
With the divine protection of the mistletoe
which dwells in neither Heaven nor Earth,

00:10:22.920 --> 00:10:24.510
pierce through the calamity to the west!

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:32.520
Is the ritual...

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:35.990
...not yet ended?!

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:41.200
Is the ritual...

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:46.630
...not yet... ended?

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:53.240
Then my regret shall not abate.

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:02.580
I'm at a disadvantage inside
of the Katsuragi's barrier.

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:05.490
You're more capable than I first thought.

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:09.390
However, that was merely
one of the oni's shadows.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.720
The actual creature is another matter entirely.

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:15.300
I expect a good job, Astral.

00:11:17.270 --> 00:11:18.240
What's that mean?

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:28.980
As the ritual approaches,
the oni come like a swarm.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:30.780
Tatsumi.

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:33.150
Has it really been three years?

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.950
The mountains, the land,
the wind, and water here...

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:40.050
So familiar to me, dyed as they are with
the presence of the Katsuragi family.

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:41.660
Is Kaori well?

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:46.200
That's why you're performing the ritual.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:48.830
Keep your eyes on Astral.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:50.530
I'm to spy on them?

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:54.040
Will Mikan be attending the ritual as well?

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:57.340
Even that girl has her uses.

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:00.140
"That girl," huh?

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:01.410
What?

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:02.370
Nothing.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:08.450
It seems you've learned a
few things in your absence.

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:12.260
Mainly that the workaday world is dull.

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:15.920
It's about Miss Kaori...

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:17.960
I see.

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:21.200
Find her in time for the ritual, no matter what.

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:22.030
Yes, ma'am.

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:27.430
No information about Nekoyashiki?

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:29.070
It's okay.

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:30.640
Just look at Byakko.

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:32.800
Nekoyashiki is fine.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:35.440
Yeah... you're right.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:39.050
Still, there's something funny about this.

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:40.310
What?

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:43.620
They're performing a ritual to calm souls,

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:45.420
so why is an oni running wild?

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:46.730
That's right...

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:50.220
Boss!

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:53.630
When we get back, you're getting
supplementary work on Shinto.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:55.470
Right...

00:12:56.400 --> 00:13:00.670
What is this ritual the
Katsuragis are performing?

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:09.540
I'm not just a substitute!

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:13.590
I can't believe Mikan's somewhere in this house,

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:15.520
but we can't see her until the ritual is over.

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:21.450
All done?

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:22.490
Byakko!

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:31.370
I'm... not just a substitute...

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:32.970
Wait!

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:35.110
Darn it, Byakko!

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:36.640
Gotcha!

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.270
Brother Pres?

00:13:39.180 --> 00:13:39.980
Mikan!

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:41.840
Yeah!

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:42.910
Thank goodness!

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:44.550
So, here's where you are!

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:45.710
We came to see you.

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:47.180
Honami's with me, too.

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:49.650
They said that once the ritual's over,
we can go home.

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:51.650
Mikan?

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:55.630
We'll all go home together, right?

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:57.120
Yeah.

00:13:57.900 --> 00:13:59.130
All of us, together.

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:04.660
You're to assist us, Tatsumi?

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:06.730
It's nothing personal,

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:10.540
but you could find my local knowledge useful.

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:11.980
Or so the old lady says.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.210
This is business, so it's fine.

00:14:14.550 --> 00:14:18.540
But the Katsuragis' magic would be
enough to take care of an oni, surely?

00:14:18.890 --> 00:14:21.090
The strong point of Shinto is in defense,

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:22.450
but it's weak at attacks.

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:25.060
So the closer they get to the ritual,

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:28.620
their practitioners get
too exhausted to perform it.

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:31.830
Not enough people and the
wrong magical specialty, huh?

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:32.990
As you say.

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:42.770
What's that?

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:45.300
A fragment of the oni's clothing.

00:14:45.710 --> 00:14:50.210
It would vanish if left alone,
but is maintained via spell power.

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:52.140
You're maintaining a path with it?

00:14:54.360 --> 00:15:02.190
And thus I, together with my deity,
request that every prayer be fulfilled.

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:09.260
Follow it.

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:13.170
It should lead you to the oni's true form.

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:16.740
Have we arrived?

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:19.810
Where are we?

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:21.680
Asukagawa.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.450
Ikatsuchi Hill.

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:25.750
Is the oni here?

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:29.880
I don't see anything suspicious at all.

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:33.490
Yeah. As far as one can normally see.

00:15:34.230 --> 00:15:39.390
Long ago, many dynasties rose and
then fell to insurrections here.

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:44.740
Hundreds and thousands of corpses
have accumulated in this place,

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:47.040
the land literally weeping with
their lingering resentment.

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:50.180
That itself became a power...

00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:53.700
...that clings to the land as a
crystallization of their feelings.

00:15:54.150 --> 00:15:57.850
In a way, this place is a graveyard
with no grave markers.

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:01.750
The ritual awakens this
dormant spell power, doesn't it?

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:04.120
From above,

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:06.730
the entire hill is showing
low-level spell wave contamination,

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:08.700
even though it isn't night time.

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:10.890
It's all very strange.

00:16:12.230 --> 00:16:13.770
Boss, are you all right?

00:16:13.770 --> 00:16:15.030
Y-Yeah...

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:19.400
Boss! Are you okay?!

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:23.400
Is the ritual not yet ended?

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:27.840
Is the ritual not yet ended?

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:29.910
So many of them!

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:31.580
A layer of resentment.

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:35.750
This is definitely the oni's den!

00:16:54.480 --> 00:16:55.500
I'm charging in!

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:56.340
Right!

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:57.270
Hail!

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:16.750
Is the ritual not yet ended?

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:19.960
Tatsumi!

00:17:22.740 --> 00:17:23.730
That was close.

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:25.640
There's no end to them!

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:26.870
What do we do?

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:30.810
Let's run!

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:32.540
We can escape through there!

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:34.070
Boss, you can tell?

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:38.210
This spell power or pressure or whatever
it is seems to only be weak there.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:39.350
Tatsumi!

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:42.960
When I distract them with my mistletoe, run!

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:44.290
Gotcha!

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:46.020
Boss, guide me.

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:46.720
Right.

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:48.990
On the count of three.

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:53.670
3... 2... 1... 0!

00:17:53.730 --> 00:17:55.330
Stay away from it!

00:17:55.570 --> 00:17:56.500
Nekoyashiki?

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:57.700
Why?

00:17:59.410 --> 00:17:59.640
Boss!

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:00.200
Hey!
Boss!

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:05.940
Spell wave contamination?!

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:09.550
Boss!

00:18:20.230 --> 00:18:21.250
Where?

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:23.960
Relax, you're inside the flower enchantment.

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:26.220
Well done, Byakko.

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:29.500
Well done, Mr. President.

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:30.700
Nekoyashiki!

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:31.570
Hi.

00:18:31.570 --> 00:18:33.270
What are you doing here?!

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:35.240
If you were okay, why didn't you tell us that?!

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:36.680
It's been terrible!

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:39.310
There are oni coming!
They won't let Mikan come back!

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:41.680
Where's Honami?! Where's Tatsumi?!

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.240
Tatsumi?

00:18:44.020 --> 00:18:46.610
Did Tatsumi come here, too?

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:48.510
Uh, yeah.

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:50.020
He was just with me.

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:51.960
Miss Kaori Katsuragi.

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:56.990
Mikan's older sister and the
heir to the Katsuragi family.

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:58.700
Mikan's older sister?!

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:01.530
But, why are you two here?

00:19:01.770 --> 00:19:04.330
Oh, the reason for that is simple.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:08.530
I kidnapped her.

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:11.170
Kid...

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:13.240
Kidnapped?!

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:18.240
Celtic magic...

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.720
An arbor barrier, huh?

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:22.080
Boss...

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:24.010
He's probably fine.

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:28.190
It looks like he got caught in the spell
wave contamination, not by the oni.

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:30.500
The ritual is to appease the spirits,

00:19:30.500 --> 00:19:32.730
but produces oni and spell wave contamination.

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:34.630
It's the opposite of what should happen.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:38.230
Or maybe... not the opposite.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:41.400
What if it's to intentionally draw out the oni?

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:45.610
What exactly does the Katsuragi ritual do?

00:19:47.150 --> 00:19:50.210
Tell me, or would you rather
I throw you out of here?

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:53.620
Impressive.

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:55.480
You've sniffed that much out?

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:57.250
I'm not a dog...

00:19:57.520 --> 00:20:01.930
The Katsuragi ritual... is to devour the oni.

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:07.770
The oni, which is the embodiment
of resentment, anger, and sorrow.

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:12.370
This rock is soaked in those thoughts.

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:18.080
The ritual draws the oni from the rock and
places it into the body of the next heir.

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:21.770
That is the Katsuragi ritual.

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:23.280
A ritual that produces an oni...

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.940
...so that it can be devoured?

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:28.920
If the ritual proceeds, the oni will be produced.

00:20:29.190 --> 00:20:32.320
The ritual is a system that was devised
from the very start to do this.

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:36.550
This spell wave contamination
is like the oni in another form.

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:39.660
So, you learned what the Katsuragi ritual was.

00:20:40.070 --> 00:20:42.370
Is that connected to why you kidnapped Kaori?

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:45.800
My grandmother is trying to make
sure the ritual goes perfectly.

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:49.440
To prevent a repeat of my mother's failure,

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:51.480
she's arranged for a human sacrifice.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:52.540
Human sacrifice?

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:54.510
Mikan.

00:20:55.680 --> 00:20:58.150
I couldn't let that happen to Mikan.

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:02.710
That's why asked Nekoyashiki to kidnap me.

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:07.220
Because the ritual cannot be begin
without Kaori, the next heir.

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:09.560
As long as this flower barrier holds out,

00:21:09.560 --> 00:21:11.360
the Katsuragi family can't find us.

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:14.900
All we need to do is wait for the ritual to end.

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:22.410
The ritual begins.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:30.120
Grant the duty, and grant
the great life not be mistaken!

00:21:30.120 --> 00:21:31.180
The barrier!

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:32.150
Grandmother!

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:33.850
She's found us?

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:41.860
The ritual begins.

00:21:58.180 --> 00:22:07.780
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:22:08.190 --> 00:22:16.190
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:22:17.460 --> 00:22:29.240
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:29.510 --> 00:22:41.150
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:41.150 --> 00:22:47.420
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:47.490 --> 00:22:51.930
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:56.200
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:56.200 --> 00:23:01.300
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:23:02.240 --> 00:23:13.180
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:17.220
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:21.500
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:24.560
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:27.070
SHINTO [SHINTO]

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:28.840
SHINTO [SHINTO]
I'm not really sure what it is.

00:23:28.840 --> 00:23:30.640
SHINTO [SHINTO]
Not surprising, since it's complicated.

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:31.070
SHINTO [SHINTO]
But I'm studying hard!

00:23:31.070 --> 00:23:31.870
But I'm studying hard!

00:23:31.870 --> 00:23:33.740
Big Sister Honami's kinda scary, huh?

00:23:33.740 --> 00:23:34.910
Mikan?

